                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "One of my favorite games of all time. An extremely progressive (in terms of game design and gameplay, maybe not so much in terms politically correct sensitivity haha), smart and funny MOBA that was a precursor to deadlock.\n\nWAY ahead of its time. This game came out right before Esports were a big things, which really hurt its long term potential. The game has a ton of depth and complexity, and while movement is pretty limited (owing to its release on console) I love it.\n\nIMO a genuine hidden gem during its era... But now? Well... All we can do is weep at what we used to have.",
